xfce-md-viewer (1.0.1) noble; urgency=low

  * Fix a crash in virtual machines without 3D acceleration: use GTK's
    OpenGL renderer unless GSK_RENDERER is set (GTK's Vulkan fallback,
    Mesa's software lavapipe driver, segfaulted).
  * The About window no longer opens with the program name selected.

